[[Armored Saurus]]es are large [[elementalist]] [[Dinosaur]]s, tamed by the [[Charr]] to break down gates and besiege fortified positions, e.g. to storm [[the hierophant's stronghold]] during [[Assault on the Stronghold]].

==Locations==
*[[Charr Homelands]]
**{{NPC location|Dalada Uplands}} (since [[What Must Be Done]])

==Missions==
*Charr Homelands
**{{NPC location|Assault on the Stronghold}}

==Skills==
*{{skill icon|Armor of Earth}}
*{{skill icon|Grasping Earth}}
*{{skill icon|Shockwave}} ([[elite]])
*{{skill icon|Sliver Armor}}
*{{skill icon|Stoneflesh Aura}}
*{{monster skill icon|Stun Immunity}}
*{{monster skill icon|Twisting Jaws}}

==Notes==
*The Armored Saurus and its counterpart [[Trihorn]] are essentially a [[Ceratadon]] without the monster skill [[Chomp]].
*During the quest [[What Must Be Done]], it is initially hostile and will turn friendly after you defeat it.
*It does not use any skills in [[Assault on the Stronghold]], making it very vulnerable unless you protect it.

==Trivia==
*At the end of the GW:EN trailer the sound made by the beast at the very end sounds like the Armored Saurus.
